north_america"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 9460, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/hnhfix5eejyzlwgagto7.jpg"}, {"id": 9458, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/vlzdzczhksdqhbdbsdlr.jpg"}, {"id": 9461, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/nnjtrul1wreshxngdn6j.jpg"}, {"id": 9459, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/ap2ns7t4ubytxql3gxxn.jpg"}, {"id": 9462, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/wi3fcappsukovod7akco.jpg"}], "slug": "samurai-warriors-4", "storyline": "Samurai Warriors 4 is set during Japan's Sengoku period, a turbulent age when the country was splintered into domains ruled by rival warlords locked in near-constant war. Across its campaigns, the game follows the famous commanders and clans of the era through a romanticized retelling of history's great battles. Players witness the long struggle to unify the land, culminating in the decisive conflicts that gave rise to a new ruling order. A parallel path highlights the celebrated Sanada clan and its own place in these sweeping events.", "summary": "Samurai Warriors 4 is a hack and slash game, and sequel to Samurai Warriors 3. The game was made to celebrate the tenth anniversary of the series. The game features a character-switching feature, similar to the spin-off, Samurai Warriors: Chronicles, with which players can take two characters into battles simultaneously, and freely switch between the two. Two new moves, \"Hyper Attacks\" and \"Rage Mode\" are featured in this game: Hyper Attacks is a secondary moveset available to all characters that allows the player to sweep through and clear out crowd of enemies with a dashing animation, although it is useless against enemy officers, as they will either deflect it or are otherwise immune against it. Rage Mode renders the player invincible for a period of time, and also enhances the player's attacks as well as empowering their Musou attack by using the Spirit Gauge.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/samurai-warriors-4", "videos": [{"id": 2570, "name": "Story Trailer", "video_id": "pQyoQj0eoZo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQyoQj0eoZo", "title": "Samurai Warriors 4 - Story Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pQyoQj0eoZo/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 2571, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "QDPoaDjT2DM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QDPoaDjT2DM", "title": "Samurai Warriors 4 - Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QDPoaDjT2DM/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 763, "name": "Samurai Warriors"}]}